{"asset_key":"ep7/gameplay_story_17600090","episode":"ep7","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"17600090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1760009001:1":{"text":"매튜! 드디어 만났어...!","source_cn":"大和！我终于见到你了……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB01E8FCC693F30B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1760009002:1":{"text":"미안해, 파피몬. 많이 기다렸지?","source_cn":"抱歉，加布兽，让你久等了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3065BB6942A419D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1760009003:0":{"text":"나를 위해 이렇게까지 해 줘서 고마워, 파피몬...","source_cn":"谢谢你为我做了这么多……谢谢你，加布兽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A8D9E2AE6845E82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1760009004:0":{"text":"괜찮아. 매튜를 다시 만날 수만 있다면 난 뭐든지 할 수 있어.","source_cn":"没关系，只要能和大和再次见面，我什么都愿意做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4606C67F97106DCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1760009005:1":{"text":"하지만... 매튜, 내가 교칙을 너무 많이 어겨서, 아주 오랫동안 갇혀 있어야 할지도 몰라.","source_cn":"只是……大和，我违反了很多校规，可能要被关很久禁闭……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51A0BF547C19671E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1760009006:1":{"text":"걱정 마. 그건 나한테 맡겨.","source_cn":"放心，这件事就交给我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25491BB85E1B472D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1760009007:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 우리를 다시 한번 칸티아스에게 데려가 줄 수 있어?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCF286BB1148CEC9A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 우리를 다시 한번 칸티아스에게 데려가 줄 수 있어?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 우리를 다시 한번 칸티아스에게 데려가 줄 수 있어?","variant_male_record_index":"238367","variant_female_record_index":"238368","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:12:1760009008:1":{"text":"나는 가디언들을 피해, 모두를 데리고 도서관의 교칙서 앞으로 돌아갔다...","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x83987F38E0AAAC15","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"나는 가디언들을 피해, 모두를 데리고 도서관의 교칙서 앞으로 돌아갔다...","female":"나는 가디언들을 피해, 모두를 데리고 도서관의 교칙서 앞으로 돌아갔다...","variant_male_record_index":"238369","variant_female_record_index":"238370","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1760009009:1":{"text":"아... 또 너희야...","source_cn":"嗯……又是你们啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE045C17503E74E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1760009010:0":{"text":"부탁할 게 있어. 파피몬이 받을 벌을 내가 대신 받을 수 있을까?","source_cn":"我有一事相求。我想申请，能不能把加布兽的惩罚，换到我身上？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F9FE599929F35D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1760009011:0":{"text":"매튜!","source_cn":"大和！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EE5E553AB846BDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1760009012:1":{"text":"오, 그래? 파피몬은 교칙을 많이 어겨서 받아야 할 처벌도 많아. 복잡하기도 하고, 꽤 무시무시할 텐데~","source_cn":"哦？加布兽违反了很多校规，要承受的惩罚可是很多、很复杂...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69220421BEFF2BF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1760009013:1":{"text":"예를 들면... 어둡고 조용한 독방에 갇힌다든가.","source_cn":"比如……被关在黑暗的、安静的禁闭室里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6204F81713963656","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1760009014:1":{"text":"아니면 라이세움에 진열된 모든 트로피와 액자를 먼지 하나 없이 전부 닦는다든가.","source_cn":"或者是把莱希拉姆所有陈列的奖杯和画框都擦一遍，一点灰尘...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6E359F899FEA13A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1760009015:1":{"text":"온실에서 온갖 고생을 다 하며 독성이 있는 마법 식물을 재배할 수도 있지...","source_cn":"又比如，在温室做苦工，培育带毒性的魔法植物……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1C82D9C4F6D1284","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1760009015":{"text":"온실에서 온갖 고생을 다 하며 독성이 있는 마법 식물을 재배할 수도 있지...","source_cn":"又比如，在温室做苦工，培育带毒性的魔法植物……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1C82D9C4F6D1284","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1760009016:1":{"text":"상관없어, 다 받아들일게.","source_cn":"没关系，我愿意接受。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FE5F5E1E413B4C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1760009017:0":{"text":"매튜...","source_cn":"大和……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92BEA20653FB3F17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1760009018:1":{"text":"나도 같이 받을게.","source_cn":"还有我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D53C9B000840127","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1760009019:1":{"text":"태일아...","source_cn":"太一？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24C03FB5C2336821","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1760009020:1":{"text":"말했잖아, 우리는 친구라고. 친구라면 서로의 어려움을 함께 나눠야지.","source_cn":"我说过，我们是同伴。同伴彼此之间，就是要一起分担困难啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB1642D1FA70341C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1760009021:1":{"text":"최대한 빨리 처벌을 받고 다 같이 돌아가자!","source_cn":"我们尽快接受完惩罚，然后一起回去吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BB1C654C589A14E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1760009022:1":{"text":"태일이가 가면 나도 갈래!","source_cn":"太一去的话，我也要去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E8DB280699835B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1760009023:1":{"text":"어휴... 꼬맹이들은 저런 낯간지러운 의리에 금방 불타오른다니까. 정말 못 말리겠네...","source_cn":"哎呀哎呀……年轻人总是这么容易因为友情而热血，真是受不了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96F1D57178056173","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1760009024:1":{"text":"뭐, 어차피 도면도 돌아왔고, 솔리스도 마법 식물 일은 더 이상 문제 삼지 않겠다고 했으니까. 너희가 받을 처벌은 이번 한 번만 특별히 없던 일로 해 줄게.","source_cn":"算啦，反正图纸也还回来了，娑丽丝也表示不追究魔法植物的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B2DDF4B4A9FEA0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1760009025:0":{"text"